# Vercel hosts ONLY the static console. The gateway is deliberately NOT deployed
# here: its correctness (exactly-once idempotency, cumulative budget, the
# single-writer hash chain) depends on one process against one disk, and
# serverless gives neither. See docs/LIMITS.md. The backend belongs on a
# single-instance host — Dockerfile and render.yaml are in the repo for that.
